                                        <depth></depth>
                                    </dimensions>
                                </support>
                            </supportDesc>
                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout>
                                    <p>Stele with pediment, acroteria, vegetable decoration, rosette in pediment. Main field with niche flanked by six-pointed stars; bust of Men with Phrygian cap, crescent, sleeved tunic, chlamys. Slightly melancholy expression. Latin dedication LVS (luna votum solvit).</p>
                                    <rs ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1">incisa a scalpello</rs>
